### Patch/update a product (only include fields you want to change) - ok
PATCH {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/products/{{productId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Origin: {{origin}}
Referer: {{origin}}/

{
  "basePrice": 1399,
  "description": "Premium beef patty with lettuce, tomato, and house special sauce"
}

### Update product availability - ok
PATCH {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/products/{{productId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Origin: {{origin}}
Referer: {{origin}}/

{
  "isActive": false
}

### Delete a product - ok
DELETE {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/products/{{productId}}
Origin: {{origin}}
Referer: {{origin}}/
